# Operator-selected Friday schedule, America/New_York (2026-11-05).
# Apply these keys to the existing deployment environment, not as a replacement
# for .env. Preserve its trading gates, state path, cadence and anchor.
# This schedules research/planning after normal COT publication. Data adapters
# and release-completion dependencies remain separate implementation work.
CRON=0 17 * * FRI
AGENTS_COMMITTEE_CRON=35 15 * * FRI
PM_PRE_CYCLE_LEAD_MINUTES=45
SCHEDULE_TZ=America/New_York
